TI  - Whole-genome sequencing of Beauveria bassiana KNU-101 using the hybrid assembly approach.
PG  - e0068123
LID - 10.1128/mra.00681-23 [doi]
LID - e00681-23
AB  - In this report, we present the whole-genome sequences of Beauveria bassiana KNU-101, a widely recognized entomopathogenic fungus used as a biopesticide. The genome was assembled using a hybrid assembly approach, resulting in 13 scaffolds with a total size of 35,638,224 bp.
